AB  - Conversational AI using smartphones is rapidly evolving; however, the impact of interacting with virtual avatars remains unclear. In this research, we suggest clarifying the influence of virtual avatar interaction on users and developing a tool that contributes to building more human-like conversational AI systems. We analyze user emotional changes and responses through conversations with a virtual avatar model equipped with AR technology and ChatGPT. After that, we will create five avatar models representing various ages and genders and numerically evaluate conversation content using emotion polarity extraction techniques.
